Package: PBPKR
Type: Package
Title: Physiologically-Based Pharmacokinetic Model for THC and CBD
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Eisa", "Mahyari", email = "eisa@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny-based interactive PBPK modeling application for simulating 
    the pharmacokinetics of THC and CBD following inhalation. The package provides
    tools to define model parameters, run simulations, and visualize predictions
    for cannabinoid disposition in various tissue compartments.
